Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,بعد ليلة المنطقة الخضراء.. بغداد تؤكد جهودها لحصر السلاح والحرب على الفساد,After the night of the Green Zone... Baghdad confirms its efforts to limit weapons and fight against corruption,"After the night of the Green Zone... Baghdad confirms its efforts to limit weapons and fight against corruption Iraqi Prime Minister Ali al-Zaidi confirmed the continuation of the “religious movement” government in the war on corruption, after arresting a number of politicians and officials. حفظ شارِكْ قال رئيس الوزراء العراقيعلي الزيديإن ما حدث من اعتقالات شملت سياسيين ومسؤولين حكوميين هو مرحلة أولى ضد الفساد، مؤكدا الاستمرار في استرداد المال العام، والعمل على حصر القوة والسلاح في يد الدولة. ونقلت وكالة الأنباء العراقية (واع) عن المكتب الإعلامي لرئيس الوزراء أن الزيدي كلف الأجهزة الرقابية بتلقي أي مؤشرات على الفساد أو التقصير في أداء الوزارات. وأشار إلى أن ""العراق مر بحقب الحروب والفوضى ومقارعة الإرهاب، واليوم بات مسار الحكومة مختلفا من خلال تفعيل إجراءات تعزيز قوة الدولة العراقية، واحتكارها القوة والسلاح، وعدم السماح للفاسدين بأن يكونوا ضمن جسد الدولة بهدف سرقة المال العام"". وفي وقت مبكر من صباح أمس الأحد، شهدتالمنطقة الخضراءالمحصنة وسط العاصمة بغداد انتشارا أمنيا مكثفا، تخللته عمليات دهم واعتقال استهدفت شخصيات سياسية ومسؤولين بارزين، ضمن تحقيقات مرتبطة بملفات فساد مالي واست","Mon, 29 Jun 2026 01:08:42 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d8%b1%d8%a6%d9%8a%d8%b3-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%88%d8%b2%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%a1-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b9%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%82%d9%8a-%d9%8a%d8%a4%d9%83%d8%af-%d8%b9%d9%84%d9%89-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%85%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%b1?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:13
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,اليابان تتحدى البرازيل بهوية تكتيكية معقدة في كأس العالم,Japan challenges Brazil with a complex tactical identity in the World Cup,"Japan challenges Brazil with a complex tactical identity in the World Cup Facing the Japanese national team is no longer just an outing for the game's seniors, but has become a terrifying tactical test that everyone fears. Today, the Brazilian national team, led by coach Carlo Ancelotti, stands in front of the “Samurai” wall. Steel. حفظ شارِكْ تترقب الجماهير العالمية مواجهة نارية غير محسومة النتائج تجمع بين المنتخبين البرازيلي والياباني، في لقاء يحمل الكثير من الحسابات الفنية والمعقدة. Despite the remarkable performance shown by the Brazilian national team, the coach of the Seleção, Carlo Ancelotti, prefers to face Sweden instead of clashing with the Japanese national team. Due to the stubbornness of the ""Samurai"" and his tactical ferocity, which does not give opponents any chance to breathe, which he recently demonstrated by defeating the greats of the game such as Germany and Spain, and forcing the Netherlands to draw. Japanese equality is not just expectations, but is supported by recent historical facts. In October 2025, at Ajinomoto Stadium in Tokyo, Japan succeeded in achieving its first historic victory over Brazil with a score of (3-2). Although the next confrontation will bring together the same coaches, Ancelotti and Moriyasu, the tactical structure has witnessed some changes. في تلك المباراة، تألف ا","Mon, 29 Jun 2026 01:04:38 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a8%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%b2%d9%8a%d9%84-%d8%aa%d9%83%d8%aa%d9%8a%d9%83-%d8%aa%d8%ad%d8%af%d9%8a?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:14
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,اتفاق مبدئي بين سان جيرمان والنجم الإيفواري ديوماندي,A preliminary agreement between Saint-Germain and Ivorian star Diomande,"A preliminary agreement between Saint-Germain and Ivorian star Diomande The brilliance of many talents in the 2026 World Cup caught the attention of many major European clubs, prompting Saint-Germain to strengthen its ranks with a player with extraordinary technical abilities. حفظ شارِكْ اقترب باريس سان جيرمان من حسم واحدة من أبرز الصفقات الشابة في سوق الانتقالات الصيفية، بعدما توصل إلى اتفاق مبدئي مع الجناح الإيفواري يان ديوماندي تمهيدا لانضمامه إلى الفريق عقب نهاية كأس العالم 2026. ويأتي تحرك النادي الفرنسي بعد المستويات اللافتة التي قدمها اللاعب البالغ من العمر 19 عاما مع منتخب كوت ديفوار خلال المونديال، إضافة إلى موسمه المميز مع لايبزيغ الألماني، الأمر الذي جعله محل اهتمام عدد من الأندية الأوروبية الكبرى. وبحسب ما أوردته شبكة ""آر إم سي سبورت"" (RMC Sport)، فإن ديوماندي منح الأولوية لباريس سان جيرمان رغم اهتمام ليفربول بالحصول على خدماته خلال الفترة الأخيرة. وأضاف المصدر ذاته أن اتفاقا مبدئيا جرى بين الطرفين بشأن عقد يمتد لخمس سنوات، على أن ينتقل اللاعب إلى النادي الباريسي بعد نهاية مشاركته في كأس العالم عام 2026. وكانت إدارة باريس تنتظر موقفا واضحا من اللاعب ","Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:25:33 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d9%8a%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%af%d9%8a%d9%88%d9%85%d9%88%d9%86%d8%af%d9%8a-%d8%b3%d8%a7%d9%86-%d8%ac%d9%8a%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%86-%d9%83%d9%88%d8%aa-%d8%af%d9%8a%d9%81%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b1?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:15
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,وثيقة استقلال أمريكا.. تدهورت حالتها الفيزيائية فماذا عن مبادئها؟,"America's Declaration of Independence... Its physical condition has deteriorated, so what about its principles?","America's Declaration of Independence... Its physical condition has deteriorated, so what about its principles? As the 250th anniversary of America's independence approaches, The Washington Post shed light on the Declaration of Independence, and set out from its deteriorating physical state to question the currentity of its principles and content and the contradictions it reflects since its founding. حفظ شارِكْ مع اقتراب الذكرى الـ250 لإعلان استقلالالولايات المتحدة الأمريكيةفي 4 يوليو/تموز 2026، يتجدد الجدل حول الوثيقة المؤسسة للدولة الأمريكية، ليس بسبب حالتها الفيزيائية المتدهورة فحسب، وإنما بسبب التناقض بين المبادئ التي أعلنتها والواقع الذي رافق نشأة البلاد. ويلاحظ تقرير نشرتهواشنطن بوستأن إعلان استقلال أمريكا تحول من مجرد وثيقة تاريخية إلى محور سجال مستمر بين من يعتبره رمزا للحرية والديمقراطية، ومن يرى أنه يجسد أيضا مفارقات تأسيس الولايات المتحدة، إذ أعلن المساواة بينما أبقى ملايين البشر خارج نطاقها. وتشير الصحيفة إلى أن أكثر من مليون زائر يقصدون سنويا مبنى الأرشيف الوطني لمشاهدة الوثيقة الأصلية، لكنهم يفاجؤون بحالتها الباهتة؛ فقد تلاشى الحبر إلى حد يكاد يجعل التوقيعات غير مقروءة، كما تغطيها طيات وبقع مياه وآثار يد غامضة لا يزال مصدرها مجهولا. However, according to the report, this deterioration has not occurred","Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:04:19 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/politics/2026/6/29/%d9%88%d8%ab%d9%8a%d9%82%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%aa%d9%82%d9%84%d8%a7%d9%84-%d8%a3%d9%85%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%83%d8%a7-%d8%aa%d8%af%d9%87%d9%88%d8%b1%d8%aa-%d8%ad%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%aa%d9%87%d8%a7?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:15
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,هل يكسر المنتخب الهولندي العقدة التاريخية في المونديال؟,Will the Dutch national team break the historical knot in the World Cup?,"Will the Dutch national team break the historical knot in the World Cup? The Netherlands national team is looking to achieve a long-awaited dream in the World Cup after three attempts in which it evaded the title, amid a strong performance in the current edition that enhances its chances among the candidates. حفظ شارِكْ بعد عروض هولندية قوية في دور المجموعات، تجددت آمال هولندا في الظفر بلقب المونديال الذي استعصى عليها ثلاث مرات أعوام 1974 و1978 و2010. However, the “Mills” are facing a decisive test in Monterrey, where they face in the round of 32 the brilliant Moroccan team, which achieved historical achievement in the last edition, in an anticipated summit that will determine who will continue the path to the podiums. In the first round, Ronald Koeman's team defeated Tunisia (3-1) in Kansas City, last Thursday, to lead Group F with seven points, ahead of Japan and Sweden, who also qualified for the round of 32. Koeman was asked after the Tunisia match if his team had accomplished the most difficult part by topping their group and avoiding Brazil, which topped Morocco on goal difference, and he responded by saying: “We have to prepare for Morocco because it will be a big match.” He added: ""It is a good team that has a lot of quality and can score easily."" The Netherlands is the...","Mon, 29 Jun 2026 00:03:25 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d9%87%d9%84-%d8%aa%d8%ad%d9%82%d9%82-%d9%87%d9%88%d9%84%d9%86%d8%af%d8%a7-%d9%84%d9%82%d8%a8-%d9%83%d8%a3%d8%b3-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85-2026?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:16
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,"بعد 8 سنوات.. أوستاكيو يستحضر ""هدف الشاذلي"" الشهير في مونديال 2018",After 8 years.. Eustaquio recalls the famous “Chadli goal” in the 2018 World Cup,"After 8 years.. Eustaquio recalls the famous “Chadli goal” in the 2018 World Cup Thanks to a fatal goal by Stephen Eustaquio, Canada qualified for the World Cup final, setting up a fiery match with the winner of the match between Morocco and the Netherlands. حفظ شارِكْ دوّن ستيفن أوستاكيو اسمه في سجلات التاريخ، مسجلا هدف المباراة الوحيد في الدقيقة 90+2، ليمنح منتخب كندا بطاقة عبور تاريخية وغير مسبوقة إلى ثمن النهائي. With this valuable victory, the Canucks set an anticipated date in the next round with the winner of the anticipated summit between Morocco and the Netherlands, scheduled to be held on Tuesday, June 30, in the city of Monterrey. ويُعد هذا الهدف علامة فارقة في سجل المونديال، إذ أصبح أوستاكيو أول لاعب يحرز هدفا حاسما في اللحظات الأخيرة من مباراة إقصائية في كأس العالم، منذ الهدف الشهير للبلجيكي ناصر الشاذلي في شباك اليابان خلال مونديال 2018. جاءت المباراة في طابعها العام متكافئة إلى حد كبير، حيث خاض المنتخبان الأدوار الإقصائية للمرة الأولى في تاريخهما، وهو ما انعكس على الأداء في الشوط الأول الذي طغى عليه حذر تكتيكي واضح من الجانبين. ورغم أن كندا تعد إحدى الدول المضيفة للبطولة إلى جانب الو","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:43:08 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d8%a8%d8%b9%d8%af-8-%d8%b3%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d8%a3%d9%88%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%83%d9%8a%d9%88-%d9%8a%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%ad%d8%b6%d8%b1-%d9%87%d8%af%d9%81?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:17
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,عشرات القتلى في عملية باكستانية على الحدود مع أفغانستان,Dozens were killed in a Pakistani operation on the border with Afghanistan,"Dozens were killed in a Pakistani operation on the border with Afghanistan Pakistan announced that its security forces carried out a ground operation along the border with Afghanistan, killing dozens. حفظ شارِكْ أعلنت باكستان أن قواتها الأمنية نفذت عملية برية على طول الحدود معأفغانستانمما أسفر عن مقتل العشرات. The Associated Press quoted military officials in Pakistan, “The security forces carried out a ground operation based on intelligence information along the Pakistani-Afghan border, followed by precisely calculated strikes that targeted hideouts and safe havens for militants in the border region, resulting in the killing of 29 militants.” من جهتها، قالت الحكومة الأفغانية إن عشرات الضحايا المدنيين سقطوا جراء الضربات الباكستانية في شرق أفغانستان. وقال المتحدث باسم حكومة طالبان ذبيح الله مجاهد -في بيان على منصة ""إكس"" اليوم الاثنين- إن الغارات الجوية استهدفت ولايات باكتيكا وباكتيا وكونار، وأدت إلى مقتل وإصابة العشرات من المدنيين. وندد ذبيح الله بالضربات العسكرية الباكستانية التي وصفها بأنها ""عمل عدواني جبان"". The operation came a day after an attack by gunmen","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:19:08 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d8%b9%d8%b4%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%82%d8%aa%d9%84%d9%89-%d8%a8%d8%b9%d9%85%d9%84%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%83%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%b9%d9%84%d9%89?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:18
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,قصف إسرائيلي على درعا ودمشق تدعو لاحترام اتفاقية فض الاشتباك,Israeli bombing of Daraa and Damascus calls for respecting the Disengagement Agreement,"Israeli bombing of Daraa and Damascus calls for respecting the Disengagement Agreement The Israeli occupation bombed with artillery the village of Abdeen in the Yarmouk Basin, southern Syria, after residents blocked a road in front of its patrol earlier on Sunday, while Damascus called for an end to Israeli violations. Save Share - On Sunday evening, Israeli occupation artillery bombed the village of Abdeen in the western countryside of Daraa, southern Syria, after an earlier incursion by its vehicles into the Yarmouk Basin area, while the Syrian Ministry of Foreign Affairs called on the United Nations and the international community to put an end to these violations and ensure respect for the Disengagement Agreement. Al Jazeera's correspondent reported that occupation artillery bombed the village of Abdeen amid an Israeli escalation, after the villagers confronted a patrol that included several occupation vehicles and blocked the road with stones earlier. The reporter explained that artillery shells fell on agricultural lands belonging to Abdeen, coinciding with a helicopter flight that targeted the outskirts of the village with machine guns, and threw thermal balloons into the atmosphere of the Yarmouk Basin. The ""Syria Now"" platform's correspondent pointed to a massive exodus of people from Abdeen towards neighboring areas, confirming the continued state of tension and Israeli aircraft flying over the area's airspace and even the Quneitra countryside. And in Asia","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:18:42 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d9%82%d8%b5%d9%81-%d8%a5%d8%b3%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%a6%d9%8a%d9%84%d9%8a-%d8%b9%d9%84%d9%89-%d8%b9%d8%a7%d8%a8%d8%af%d9%8a%d9%86-%d8%a8%d8%af%d8%b1%d8%b9%d8%a7-%d9%88%d8%af%d9%85%d8%b4%d9%82?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:19
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,حضور لافت لكاب فيردي.. التشكيلة المثالية لدور المجموعات من مونديال 2026,A remarkable presence for Cape Verde...the ideal lineup for the group stage of the 2026 World Cup,"A remarkable presence for Cape Verde...the ideal lineup for the group stage of the 2026 World Cup The ideal lineup for the group stage of the World Cup included surprises imposed by the language of numbers, as rising names from obscure teams competed with world football legends on the list of the best. Save Share The Opta network, which specializes in football statistics, revealed the ideal lineup for the group stage of the 2026 World Cup, after the conclusion of the first round competitions and determining the qualifiers for the round of 32. The squad witnessed an exciting balance between the big stars of the game and the young and unknown names that made a difference and made history with their country’s teams (especially the Cape Verdean team). The ideal lineup based on numbers and data was as follows: The offensive line in the Opta lineup was distinguished by its extraordinary attacking tendency, with the presence of the terrifying quartet (Messi, Mbappe, Haaland, and Vinicius), who controlled the statistical numbers and the rates of creating and scoring chances achieved during the first three rounds of the World Cup.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:18:15 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%aa%d8%b4%d9%83%d9%8a%d9%84%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%ab%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%af%d9%88%d8%b1-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%ac%d9%85%d9%88%d8%b9%d8%a7%d8%aa?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:20
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,موعد مباراة المغرب ضد هولندا في دور الـ32 من كأس العالم عام 2026 والقنوات الناقلة,The date of the match between Morocco and the Netherlands in the round of 32 of the World Cup in 2026 and the broadcast channels,"The date of the match between Morocco and the Netherlands in the round of 32 of the World Cup in 2026 and the broadcast channels We review the details of the date of the African-European summit in the round of 32 of the World Cup in 2026 between two candidates to go far in the tournament: Morocco and the Netherlands. Save Share The Dutch and Moroccan teams collide at Monterrey Stadium in the round of 32 of the 2026 World Cup, in one of the most exciting confrontations of this round, given the levels presented by the two teams during the group stage. The two teams reached the qualifying rounds with seven points each, after the Netherlands topped their group, while Morocco finished as runner-up, setting up a date that promises a lot of excitement and competition. The Moroccan national team arrives at the confrontation buoyed by its victory over Haiti 4-2 in the final round of the group stage, a result that extended its unbeaten streak to 32 matches. The ""Atlas Lions"" showed clear attacking power during the tournament, after scoring in all their matches in the group stage, with a remarkable ability to settle matches early. Ismail Saibari stands out as one of the most prominent stars of the Moroccan national team, after scoring three goals in the tournament, including two goals that opened the scoring, becoming one of the most prominent players in the tournament.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 22:47:08 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d9%85%d9%88%d8%b9%d8%af-%d9%85%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%ba%d8%b1%d8%a8-%d8%b6%d8%af-%d9%87%d9%88%d9%84%d9%86%d8%af%d8%a7-%d9%81%d9%8a-%d8%af%d9%88%d8%b1?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:21
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,لماذا انهزم الحلم الأمريكي في المونديال؟,Why was the American dream defeated in the World Cup?,"Why was the American dream defeated in the World Cup? By making shocking decisions against teams and fans who came to participate in the World Cup, it became clear to many that America, with the Trump administration, is continuing to get rid of the pillars of its soft power, which it began in the field of immigration and education, and will not end in the field of sports. Researcher, author, media consultant, writer and analyst on European and international affairs, social issues and media issues. Save Share In the minds of the world, there was no country like any other. It was surrounded by an exceptional aura and associated with dreamy perceptions for nearly a century and a half. The United States of America's standing in the minds and consciences increased with its rise to the international stage, strengthened by a cultural industry in cinema, music and singing, an unparalleled leadership in science, technology and space entrepreneurship, and an economic abundance that stimulated a consumer pattern that seduced the entire world. The ""American Dream"" haunted generations of people who looked forward to trying their chances by requesting to immigrate to the ""land of opportunities in the New World,"" or by imitating the ""American way of life"" by drawing inspiration from its consumerist traditions in food, drink, clothing, riding, and living. This impressionistic aura had an impact in uprooting the Iron Curtain from Europe, and sweeping away the European model.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 22:43:49 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/opinions/2026/6/29/%d9%85%d9%88%d9%86%d8%af%d9%8a%d8%a7%d9%84-%d8%a8%d9%84%d8%a7-%d9%85%d9%83%d8%a7%d8%b3%d8%a8-%d8%a3%d9%85%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%83%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%a8%d9%85%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b2%d9%8a%d9%86?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:22
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,5 فرص وهدف قاتل.. كندا الأكثر تسديدا وجنوب أفريقيا ضحية السيطرة العقيمة,"5 chances and a fatal goal.. Canada shot the most, and South Africa was a victim of futile control","5 chances and a fatal goal.. Canada shot the most, and South Africa was a victim of futile control The Canadian-South African summit carried exceptional numbers in the first clash in the round of 32 of the World Cup in 2026. Save Share The South African national team exited the 2026 World Cup in the round of 32 after its fatal loss to Canada 0-1, in a match that revealed many contradictions between possession and formal control on the one hand, and offensive effectiveness and decisiveness in the last moments on the other hand. While the Canadian team needed a late goal to snatch the pass, the numbers reflected the extent of Canada's superiority and the difficulties faced by the ""Bafana Bafana"" team throughout the match. Steven Eustaquio stole the show after scoring the winning goal in the 90th minute, becoming the first player to score a decisive goal in regular time in a World Cup elimination match since Belgian Nacer Chadli's goal against Japan during the 2018 World Cup. The goal came to give Canada the qualification ticket after a confrontation that remained open until its final minutes, before the Canadian midfielder decided it in a fatal time. Despite the South African team's possession of the ball for long periods, the team struggled offensively","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 22:15:14 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d9%83%d9%86%d8%af%d8%a7-%d8%ac%d9%86%d9%88%d8%a8-%d8%a3%d9%81%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%82%d9%8a%d8%a7-%d8%a3%d9%88%d8%b3%d8%aa%d8%a7%d9%83%d9%8a%d9%88-%d9%83%d8%a3%d8%b3-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:23
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,"""الرابط لا يعمل"".. معاناة إيمان وطلاب غزة في الامتحانات الإلكترونية",“The link does not work.” The suffering of Iman and Gaza students in electronic exams,"“The link does not work.” The suffering of Iman and Gaza students in electronic exams An experience reported by Al Jazeera Mubasher documents the suffering of high school students in Gaza, as searching for the Internet and electricity and overcoming technical malfunctions turn into challenges that precede taking electronic exams. Save Share Every exam morning, student Iman Awad leaves the displacement tent accompanied by her father, not to the exam hall, but in search of a place that provides electricity and the Internet, and between the crowded tents and the breakdown of electronic links, the journey to take the exam turns into another test that adds to the burdens of high school students in the Gaza Strip. This suffering is documented by a field experience reported by Al Jazeera Live, during which I accompanied the student Iman Awad, who is in the twelfth grade (scientific branch), from the time she left the displacement tent until she took the electronic exam, revealing part of the reality experienced by thousands of students who take their exams amid displacement and the interruption of basic services. Iman's journey begins from the displacement tent, where she makes her way with her father through the narrow corridors made by adjacent tents, before arriving at one of the temporary cafés equipped with internet service and electricity. Her father says that the tents lack the necessities for studying, so he...","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 22:14:38 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%a8%d8%b7-%d9%84%d8%a7-%d9%8a%d8%b9%d9%85%d9%84-%d9%85%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%a7%d8%a9-%d8%a5%d9%8a%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%86-%d9%88%d8%b7%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%a8-%d8%ba%d8%b2%d8%a9?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:24
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,تحد جديد أمام العالم.. احتياطيات الذهب قد تُستنفد خلال أقل من عقدين,A new challenge facing the world... Gold reserves may be exhausted in less than two decades,"A new challenge facing the world... Gold reserves may be exhausted in less than two decades Gold has been the greatest dream of humanity and an eternal symbol of wealth, power and prestige since the dawn of history. The journey of extracting this precious metal, which began in ancient times with simple primitive tools, has today turned into a complex technological industry. Despite the development of means, human passion has not faded and the temptation of this yellow luster that extends throughout the ages has not diminished, as gold mines around the world are witnessing continuous growth that reflects the size of the historical demand for it, as global production has achieved a qualitative leap in recent times, and the total global production reached 3,670 tons, recording an increase of 1% compared to the previous year. تقرير: عمار طيبي حفظ شارِكْ","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:51:51 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/video/2026/6/29/%d8%aa%d8%ad%d8%af-%d8%ac%d8%af%d9%8a%d8%af-%d8%a3%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%85-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85-%d8%a7%d8%ad%d8%aa%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%b7%d9%8a%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b0%d9%87%d8%a8?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:25
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,مجاهد بني مفلح.. رحلة معاناة بدأت من السجن ولم تنته بالإفراج,Mujahid Bani Mufleh...a journey of suffering that began in prison and did not end with release,"Mujahid Bani Mufleh...a journey of suffering that began in prison and did not end with release After 14 months in administrative detention, Palestinian journalist Mujahid Bani Mufleh was released from prison, but the effects of detention did not leave him. A severe cerebral hemorrhage caused him to lose parts of his brain and skull, and turned the details of his life into continuous suffering. Mujahid confirms that he was subjected to starvation, humiliation, and medical neglect inside the prison, and Mujahid’s story has re-shed light on the conditions of Palestinian prisoners, especially journalists, in light of human rights warnings about continuing violations inside Israeli prisons. تقرير: ليث جعار حفظ شارِكْ","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:48:01 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/video/2026/6/29/%d9%85%d8%ac%d8%a7%d9%87%d8%af-%d8%a8%d9%86%d9%8a-%d9%85%d9%81%d9%84%d8%ad-%d8%b1%d8%ad%d9%84%d8%a9-%d9%85%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%a7%d8%a9-%d8%a8%d8%af%d8%a3%d8%aa-%d9%85%d9%86?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:26
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,بندر عباس تحت ضغط الحرب.. سوق بطيء وأسعار تقفز ومضيق هرمز في الواجهة,"Bandar Abbas is under the pressure of war... a slow market, prices jumping, and the Strait of Hormuz at the forefront","Bandar Abbas is under the pressure of war... a slow market, prices jumping, and the Strait of Hormuz at the forefront The war crisis is putting pressure on the Bandar Abbas market overlooking the Strait of Hormuz, where sales have declined and prices have risen, while the city is in the midst of escalation due to its strategic maritime location. Save Share Bandar Abbas - The effects of the war in Bandar Abbas - southern Iran - do not appear in the form of direct destruction in the streets or markets, but rather in declining sales activity, prices rising on a daily basis, and anxiety extending from the sea to small shops. The city gained its importance in the recent war from its location overlooking the Strait of Hormuz, one of the most sensitive sea lanes in the world, where part of people’s lives are linked to the sea, the port, and the movement of trade and energy across the Gulf. Hence, the military tension turned into a living pressure that includes vendors and customers alike, in a city that finds itself between the weight of geography and the calculations of war on the one hand, and the daily suffering of the market on the other hand. In the fish market, one of the sellers tells Al Jazeera Net that the war directly affected his source of livelihood, because his work is primarily related to the sea. He added: “Our daily income has become 10 million tomans (Iranian currency). We sell two fish and the income is 10 million tomans. What I mean is that we are unemployed.”","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:46:42 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/politics/2026/6/29/%d8%a8%d9%86%d8%af%d8%b1-%d8%b9%d8%a8%d8%a7%d8%b3-%d8%aa%d8%ad%d8%aa-%d8%b6%d8%ba%d8%b7-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%ad%d8%b1%d8%a8-%d8%b3%d9%88%d9%82-%d8%a8%d8%b7%d9%8a%d8%a1?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:27
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,بعد مسيرة حافلة في أوروبا.. ليفاندوفسكي يختار الدوري الأمريكي,"After a busy career in Europe, Lewandowski chooses the American League","After a busy career in Europe, Lewandowski chooses the American League Polish player Robert Lewandowski will have a new experience in Major League Soccer after years he spent at FC Barcelona. Save Share Polish star Robert Lewandowski, the Spanish Barcelona striker, moved to the Chicago Fire team of the American Football League (MLS). Italian journalist Fabrizio Romano indicated - on Sunday - on his Instagram account that Lewandowski had reached an official agreement after his meeting with officials of the American club Chicago Fire, which had sought to include him since last December. The Polish striker met in Barcelona with Gregg Berhalter, the sporting director of the American club, who made a two-season offer. Romano said: “The Polish striker agreed to join the Chicago Fire after visiting the club and the city two weeks ago. Lewandowski will sign a two-year contract early next week, ready to start a new chapter in Major League Soccer.” Lewandowski is scheduled to travel to the United States soon to sign his new contract, and his signing will likely be officially announced on Monday.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:40:00 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/sport/2026/6/29/%d8%a8%d8%b9%d8%af-%d9%85%d8%b3%d9%8a%d8%b1%d8%a9-%d8%ad%d8%a7%d9%81%d9%84%d8%a9-%d9%81%d9%8a-%d8%a3%d9%88%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%a8%d8%a7-%d9%84%d9%8a%d9%81%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%af%d9%88%d9%81%d8%b3%d9%83%d9%8a?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:29
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,ذوو الإعاقة في غزة.. معاناة تتفاقم مع استمرار الحرب,People with disabilities in Gaza: suffering that worsens as the war continues,"People with disabilities in Gaza: suffering that worsens as the war continues The consequences of the ongoing war in the Gaza Strip did not stop at the massive destruction and huge human losses, but rather extended to create a tragic transformation in the lives of thousands of people who were left with permanent disabilities that completely changed the course of their reality. In this context, a UN report issued to coincide with the International Day of Hearing and Visual Disability revealed shocking figures documenting that tens of thousands of Gazans suffered severe and severe hearing damage. As a result of continuous bombing waves and huge explosions since October 2023. Report: Osama Muhammad Reading: Younes Ait Yassin Save Share","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:39:18 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/video/2026/6/29/%d8%b0%d9%88%d9%88-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a5%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%82%d8%a9-%d9%81%d9%8a-%d8%ba%d8%b2%d8%a9-%d9%85%d8%b9%d8%a7%d9%86%d8%a7%d8%a9-%d8%aa%d8%aa%d9%81%d8%a7%d9%82%d9%85-%d9%85%d8%b9?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:31
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,زلزال فنزويلا.. فرق الإنقاذ تواصل البحث عن الناجين,Venezuela earthquake... Rescue teams continue searching for survivors,"Venezuela earthquake... Rescue teams continue searching for survivors In the San Bernardino region, north of the Venezuelan capital, Caracas, where rescue teams are racing against time to reach those trapped under tons of rubble, local rescue teams and volunteers are working to remove the rubble, perhaps finding those alive underneath. وبحسب السلطات الفنزويلية، فإن الزلزالين اللذين ضربا البلاد فجر الخميس الماضي يُعدّان الأقوى منذ نحو قرن كامل، وتسببا حتى الآن في وفاة أكثر من 1600 شخص، إضافة إلى أكثر من 3200 جريح، فضلاً عن آلاف المشردين الذين فقدوا منازلهم. Report: Ahmed Jarrar Save Share","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:34:34 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/video/2026/6/29/%d8%b2%d9%84%d8%b2%d8%a7%d9%84-%d9%81%d9%86%d8%b2%d9%88%d9%8a%d9%84%d8%a7-%d9%81%d8%b1%d9%82-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a5%d9%86%d9%82%d8%a7%d8%b0-%d8%aa%d9%88%d8%a7%d8%b5%d9%84-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a8%d8%ad%d8%ab?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:32
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,رئيسة سلوفينيا: التدخلات الإسرائيلية في الانتخابات تهدد الديمقراطية الأوروبية,President of Slovenia: Israeli interference in the elections threatens European democracy,"President of Slovenia: Israeli interference in the elections threatens European democracy Slovenian President Natasa Burke Musar painted a comprehensive picture of her positions on the most prominent international issues, from the war on Gaza to the future of Europe and relations with Russia and the United States. She stressed that her political compass is based on human rights and international law before any political calculations. In her conversation with Ali Al-Dhafiri, presenter of the “Al-Muqabalah” program on Al-Jazeera, the President of Slovenia also opened a thorny issue related to foreign interference in European democracies, specifically what was raised about the Israeli company “Black Cube” and its influence on the course of the elections, stressing that any attempt to influence the choices of voters from outside the country represents an assault on the essence of the democratic process. She said that Slovenians were shocked when the “Black Cube” issue emerged, because foreign interference in elections during election campaigns does not merely represent political competition, but rather constitutes a direct threat to democracy. She pointed out that Slovenia is not the only country that has faced such phenomena, pointing to experiences witnessed by other European countries, such as Hungary, Romania, Cyprus, and the United Kingdom during the referendum to exit the European Union.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:33:09 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/video/the-interview/2026/6/29/%d8%b1%d8%a6%d9%8a%d8%b3%d8%a9-%d8%b3%d9%84%d9%88%d9%81%d9%8a%d9%86%d9%8a%d8%a7-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%aa%d8%af%d8%ae%d9%84%d8%a7%d8%aa-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%a5%d8%b3%d8%b1%d8%a7%d8%a6%d9%8a%d9%84%d9%8a%d8%a9?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:33
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,هرمز بين مسارين إيراني وعُماني.. ما الذي تشتهيه السفن؟,Hormuz is between Iranian and Omani routes.. What do ships desire?,"Hormuz is between Iranian and Omani routes.. What do ships desire? Ships wishing to cross the Strait of Hormuz find themselves obliged to choose between two paths: the Iranian or the Omani. However, the competition between the two paths over the management of navigation in the strait puts shipping companies in a state of uncertainty. Save Share In an attempt to explain the return of tension to the heart of the Strait of Hormuz, about 10 days after the conclusion of a memorandum of understanding between Washington and Tehran, analysts point to the emergence of different paths competing in managing navigation traffic in the Strait. The United States and Iran have exchanged bombardments - since last Friday - a day after the Sultanate of Oman announced the designation of a new corridor in Hormuz, a step that was welcomed by the Gulf and the United States, and angered Tehran, which warned against ships crossing outside the routes it had specified. The regional and global political and diplomatic arena is witnessing an intense movement to reorganize navigation in Hormuz and ensure the continued flow of oil and gas without obstacles or additional fees, amid differences in positions regarding the mechanisms for managing this vital artery through which about 20% of global energy trade passes. The Strait of Hormuz borders Iran to the north and the Sultanate of Oman and the United Arab Emirates to the south. Its width is about 50 kilometers, while its width is about 50 kilometers.","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:32:37 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d9%87%d8%b1%d9%85%d8%b2-%d8%a8%d9%8a%d9%86-%d9%85%d8%b3%d8%a7%d8%b1%d9%8a%d9%86-%d8%a5%d9%8a%d8%b1%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%8a-%d9%88%d8%b9%d9%85%d8%a7%d9%86%d9%8a-%d9%85%d8%a7-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b0%d9%8a?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:34
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,الشيخة حسينة تتعهد بالعودة إلى بنغلاديش رغم حكم إعدام,Sheikh Hasina vows to return to Bangladesh despite death sentence,"Sheikh Hasina vows to return to Bangladesh despite death sentence Former Prime Minister of Bangladesh, Sheikh Hasina, said that she intends to return to her country this year, despite a death sentence in absentia in cases related to crimes against humanity, stressing that the conviction was politically motivated. Save Share Former Bangladeshi Prime Minister Sheikh Hasina pledged to return to her country “this year,” according to an interview broadcast on Sunday, months after a death sentence was issued against her in absentia on charges related to crimes against humanity. Hasina (78 years old) fled to India in August 2024 following a student uprising that ended her 15-year rule. Since then, she has only appeared in public once, during a rare meeting with journalists in New Delhi last January. She said in an interview with the Indian channel ""NDT"" that she does not fear death, and described the sentence issued against her as ""part of an illegal, unconstitutional and politically motivated process."" She added that she was the target of ""many conspiracies"" hatched against her, stressing that she was elected prime minister five times by the will of the people, and that she led unprecedented development in the country. In response to a question about the possibility of her returning despite the death sentence, she said, “I will return to my country this year, despite all the obstacles and conspiracies.”","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:31:53 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b4%d9%8a%d8%ae%d8%a9-%d8%ad%d8%b3%d9%8a%d9%86%d8%a9-%d8%aa%d8%aa%d8%b9%d9%87%d8%af-%d8%a8%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b9%d9%88%d8%af%d8%a9-%d8%a5%d9%84%d9%89?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:35
Al Jazeera (AR),Middle East (Arabic),ar,إسرائيل تلجأ لاسم جديد من أجل تسويق خطة تهجير غزة,Israel resorts to a new name in order to market its plan to displace Gaza,"Israel resorts to a new name in order to market its plan to displace Gaza The Hebrew Channel 13 reported that instructions had been issued to Israeli security officials and the Mossad to abandon the use of the term “voluntary immigration.” In reference to the plan to displace the population of the Gaza Strip. Save Share After the failure of its efforts to displace Palestinians from the Gaza Strip, through what is called “voluntary migration,” the Israeli occupation resorted to replacing the plan with a new name and term in a move that comes days after it revived the issue in a high-ranking security meeting. The Hebrew Channel 13 reported that the occupation had issued instructions to Israeli security officials and the Mossad to abandon the use of the term “voluntary migration” in referring to the plan to displace the population of the Gaza Strip. She explained that the decision came after the term received severe international criticism, as the international community considered it a promotion of forced displacement, which prevented many countries from agreeing to absorb the citizens of Gaza. She indicated that from now on the plan will be referred to in all official discussions and summonses as the “Freedom of Movement Plan,” noting that sources familiar with relations with the countries concerned expressed their optimism about this. The sources considered that changing the terminology is expected to lead to a shift","Sun, 28 Jun 2026 21:31:37 +0300",https://www.aljazeera.net/news/2026/6/29/%d9%85%d9%86-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%87%d8%ac%d8%b1%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d8%b7%d9%88%d8%b9%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%a5%d9%84%d9%89-%d8%ad%d8%b1%d9%8a%d8%a9-%d8%a7%d9%84%d9%85%d8%b1%d9%88%d8%b1?traffic_source=rss,2026-06-29 02:07:37
