ted on X. ""Ame","Sat, 27 Jun 2026 22:08:29 -0400",https://www.foxnews.com/world/american-rescue-teams-pull-infant-alive-rubble-venezuela-days-devastating-twin-earthquakes,2026-06-29 02:10:43
